{"id":"ndfb55ef126","headline":"US Encourages Iraq and Venezuela to Leave OPEC Amid Production Concerns","summary":"The U.S. administration encouraged founding OPEC members Iraq and Venezuela to leave the cartel earlier this year to increase oil production. Both nations have so far brushed aside the push.","why":"OPEC coordinates petroleum policies and production quotas among member states to influence global oil prices, making the potential exit of major producers geopolitically and economically significant.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Washington","country":"United States of America","lat":38.895,"lon":-77.036,"region":"na"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"OilPrice.com","url":"https://oilprice.com/Latest-Energy-News/World-News/US-Pushed-Iraq-and-Venezuela-to-Consider-Quitting-OPEC-Sources-Say.html"},"sources":[{"name":"OilPrice.com","url":"https://oilprice.com/Latest-Energy-News/World-News/US-Pushed-Iraq-and-Venezuela-to-Consider-Quitting-OPEC-Sources-Say.html"},{"name":"Bloomberg HT","url":"https://www.bloomberght.com/iran-dan-abluka-tepkisi-dusman-havada-ve-denizde-eylemimizi-beklesin-3795974"}],"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:30:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-27T15:41:17Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"score":60.9,"content_hash":"0a9f86766c9f1dbe","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-5385905.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"Tho-Ge","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/rhine-industry-factory-ship-5385905/"}}